---
title: Ginger Cookies
author: Billie Odegaard
category: Cookies
cook time: 12 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@egg{1}
@shortening{0.75%cup}
@flour{2%cups}
@ginger{1%tsp}
@salt{0.25%tsp}
@white sugar{1%cup}
@molasses{4%Tbsp}
@cinnamon{1%tsp}
@baking soda{2.5%tsp}

Make into small balls and roll in white sugar. Do not flatten. Bake at 375 degrees for about 12 minutes.
